        "Description": "We all know Notable is the mascot of BB, so in his spirit we are going on a lil target spree for him. But we cant let them know where we got the costume so got to be sneaky about that.\r\rThe targets are:\rHenry Ling, a racing driver. \rJun Zheng, a event staff member. \rAnd Douglas Nelson, A event security member.\r\rAnd to get the costume we are targeting Albert Noah as we learnt off his plan to steal one.",
